abstract: >-
  A technical research framework for transforming FHIR clinical data into
  OMOP CDM 5.4, with deterministic mapping, local retrieval-augmented language
  models, human review, provenance and fail-closed publication controls.
keywords:
  - FHIR
  - OMOP CDM
  - OHDSI
  - clinical data harmonization
  - real-world evidence
  - local language models
  - human-in-the-loop
